Confirm all items are satisfied before submitting your pull request:

* [ ] **Branch Naming:** Branch conforms to `feat/JIRA-1234-brief-name` or `fix/JIRA-1234-brief-name`.
* [ ] **Conventional Commits:** PR title and commit messages follow standard format (e.g. `feat: add offline order queue`).
* [ ] **Changelog Updated:** Detailed release notes and summary added to `CHANGELOG.md`.
* [ ] **Zero Hardcoded Secrets:** No API keys, passwords, or private endpoints in source code.
* [ ] **Unit Tests:** New domain and data logic covered with unit tests maintaining the 80%+ threshold.
* [ ] **Local Doctor Pass:** Verified clean toolchain with zero compiler warnings or errors.

